-    Args:
-        store_name: short store slug (e.g. "scratchpad").
-        plan_id_hash: 16-char SHA-256 prefix of PLAN-NNN string.
-        key_hash: 16-char SHA-256 prefix of the key.
-        value_bytes: size of the stored value (post-redaction) in bytes.
